{"resourceIdentifier":"4556","resourceName":"Huaian Tech-Bank Animal Waste Management Systems (AWMS) GHG Mitigation Project","description":"Huaian Tech-Bank Animal Waste Management Systems (AWMS) GHG Mitigation Project in Jiangsu Province (hereafter referred to as “the project”) installs new animal waste management systems (AWMS) to treat the manure from 3 existing swine farms at Huaian  County, Jiangsu Province, which are owned by Tech-Bank Food Co., Ltd. Each subsidiary swine farm installs one AWMS, and the manure is treated on-site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.\r\nAll manure and wastewater will be collected and then the next step will be solid-liquid separation. The solid manure will be processed in an aerobic composting system and organic fertilizer will be produced. The liquid will be treated by anaerobic digestion and biogas produced during this treatment process will be captured and sent to an on-site torch and destroyed. The biogas residue produced after fermentation is applied as fertilizer to nearby fields, and the wastewater from the anaerobic digester is used for agricultural irrigation. For conservativeness, baseline emissions from heat generation are neglected.\r\nThe project activity will reduce G HG emissions in the atmosphere by avoiding methane emissions from the anaerobic treatment of swine manure and wastewater. The annual emission reduction is estimated as 83,245tCO2e, and the total emission reductions are estimated as582,715tCO2e throughout the crediting period.","location":{"latitude":32.933589,"longitude":118.798748},"inPublicCommentPeriod":true,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4556"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","value